    "1": "2026-11-12: the first texts of school book reports, a part of the arc a grammar: the title, the book, its author, the main characters, what happens, the favourite part, the moral of the story and the rating (its closer says \"The End\": D76), and the free slides' provocations (D79)",
    "2": "2026-11-13: shorter texts for the lower field limits (D80): the cover's titles, the author's title and fact, the favourite part, the morals and the quiz's options, the timeline's events, and the rating's labels, title and reviews; and the presenter's job on a line of its own under their name"
